      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Crop then Fit\n\nCrops an image to a region, then scales that region into a 480 by 270 thumbnail. The crop chooses the subject and the fit only sets the size. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Image\" takes the picture. \"2 Crop\" keeps the area from 80, 80 to 1000, 620. \"3 Fit\" scales the result to 480 by 270, and \"4 Thumbnail\" shows it.\n\n**Try this:** Set width and height on \"3 Fit\" to 320 by 320 for a square thumbnail, and adjust the crop to suit."
        },
